{"id":"word:hebrew:H3335","type":"word","title":"יָצַר","subtitle":"H3335 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to mould into a form; especially as a potter ; figuratively, to determine (i.e. form a resolution)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יָצַר (H3335) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 63 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יָצַר (yâtsar) means to mould into a form; especially as a potter ; figuratively, to determine (i.e. form a resolution) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 23."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יָצַר","transliteration":"yâtsar","pronunciation":"yaw-tsar'","strong":"H3335","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3335","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["יוֹצֵ֣ר","יוֹצֵ֤ר","הַ/יּוֹצֵ֑ר","הַ/יּוֹצֵ֔ר","וְ/יֹצֶרְ/ךָ֖"],"morphs":[["HTd/Vqrmsa",9],["HVqrmsa",8],["HNcmsa",4],["HVqrmsc",4],["HC/Vqw3ms",3],["HC/Vqrmsc/Sp2ms",3],["HVqp3ms",2],["HC/Vqrmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Vqrmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HVqp1cs",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to mould into a form; especially as a potter ; figuratively, to determine (i.e. form a resolution)","usage":"× earthen, fashion, form, frame, make(-r), potter, purpose.","full":"H3335. yatsar יָצַר verb form, fashion (Late Hebrew in participle יוֺצֵר potter, creator , and derivatives; Phoenician יצר potter ; יצר ᵑ7 Syriac = יֵצֶר etc.; Arabic covenant, contract ; Assyrian êƒêru, as Hebrew, Dl HWB 309 ) — Qal Perfect ׳י Isa 44:10 ; יָצָ֑ר Gen 2:8 ; suffix יְצָרָהּ Isa 45:18 ; 2 masculine יָצַרְתָּ Psa 104:26 8 t. Perfect; Imperfect 3masculine וַיִּ֫יצֶר Gen 2:7 ; וַיִּ֫צֶר 2:19 ; suffix יִצְּרֵהוּ Isa 44:12 ; 1 singular suffix אֶצֳּו֯רְךָ Jer 1:5 ; Participle יוֺצֵר Isa 41:25 20 t.; יֹצֵר 45:18 6 t.; suffix יֹצְרִי 49:5 11 t. suffix; plural יוֺצְרִים 30:14 ; 1Chr 4:23 ; construct יֹצְרֵי Isa 44:9 ; &#8212; 1 of human activity: a. of a potter who forms out of clay a vessel Isa 29:16 ; 41:25 ; Jer 18:4 (twice in verse); 18:6 (twice in verse); 1Chr 4:23 ; Lam 4:2 ; Zech 11:13 (twice in verse) (these last two according to Thes SS et al. error for אוֺצָר ); (ה)י ׳כְּלִי potter's vessel 2Sam 17:28 ; Psa 2:9 ; Jer 19:11 ; הי ׳חֹמֶר potter's clay Isa 29:16 ; י ׳נֵבֶל 30:14 ; י ׳בַּקְבֻּק Jer 19:1 הי ׳בית 18:2-3 ,. b. of a carver of wood, graven images Isa 44:9-10 , 12 ; Hab 2:18 (twice in verse). c. frame, devise in the mind ׳י עָמָל Psa 94:20 . 2 of divine activity: a. (as a potter) forming Adam out of עפר from אדמה Gen 2:7-8 , (J), beasts and birds, also from אדמה 2:19 (J); Israel as a people Isa 27:11 ; 43:1 , 21 ; 44:21 ; 45:9 (twice in verse); 45:11 ; 64:7 , even from the womb 44:2 , 24 ; the servant of Yahweh from the womb 49:5 ; of the formation of the individual man 43:7 ; Jeremiah in the womb Jer 1:5 ; the eye of man Psa 94:9 ; the locust Amos 7:1 ; Leviathan Psa 104:26 ; the dry land 95:5 ; the earth Isa 45:18 (twice in verse); the mountains Amos 4:13 ; הַכֹּל Jer 10:16 = 51:19 . Figurative perhaps lost sight of in some of the above, and quite certainly in the forming of light Isa 45:7 , of summer and winter Psa 74:17 , the רוּחַ of man Zech 12:1 , and the לב of men Psa 33:15 . b. figurative for frame, pre-ordain, plan (in divine purpose), of a situation מֵרָחוֺק Isa 22:11 ; of an occurrence קֶדֶם מִימֵי 37:26 = 2Kin 19:25 ; אֶעֱשֶׂנָּה אַף יָצַרְתִּי I have planned, I will also do it 2Ki 46:11; ׳י על רעה Jer 18:11 ; ׳י לַהֲכִינָהּ devised it to establish it 33:2 . Niph`al Perfect אֵל לֹאנֿוֺצַר לְפָנַי Isa 43:10 before me a god was not formed (created). Pu`al Perfect יצָֻּ֑רוּ יָמִים days (that) were pre-ordained (in the divine purpose) Psa 139:16 (compare Qal, 2 b ). Hoph`al Imperfect יִצְלָ֑ח לֹא עָלַיִךְ יוּצַר כָּלכְּֿלִי Isa 54:17 any weapon that is formed against thee will not prosper .","rootNote":"probably identical with 3334 (through the squeezing into shape); (compare 3331 );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 23","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 23","2Kgs 19 25","2Sam 17 28","Amos 4 13","Amos 7 1","Exod 32 4","Gen 2 7","Gen 2 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":63,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יּ֣וֹצְרִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 19 25","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וִֽ/יצַרְתִּ֑י/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqp1cs/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"2Sam 17 28","book":"2Sam","chapter":17,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹצֵ֔ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Amos 4 13","book":"Amos","chapter":4,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹצֵ֨ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Amos 7 1","book":"Amos","chapter":7,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹצֵ֣ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 32 4","book":"Exod","chapter":32,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יָּ֤צַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 2 7","book":"Gen","chapter":2,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּיצֶר֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 2 8","book":"Gen","chapter":2,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָצָֽר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 2 19","book":"Gen","chapter":2,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּצֶר֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"Hab 2 18","book":"Hab","chapter":2,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יֹצֵ֤ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 22 11","book":"Isa","chapter":22,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יֹצְרָ֥/הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Isa 27 11","book":"Isa","chapter":27,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יֹצְר֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Isa 29 16","book":"Is